  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified OAI 928 days before the posting",
  "headline_cites": ["D5"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA first posted the heparin sodium shortage on 2017-11-14 and it remains current as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["E91"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The shortage listing cites manufacturing delays with estimated recovery in late Q4 2026.",
      "cites": ["E91"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 925338 ended 2015-05-01 and was classified OAI with six observations including control procedures and investigations of failures, 928 days before the shortage posting.",
      "cites": ["D5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A Warning Letter was issued on 2017-02-14, 273 days before the shortage posting.",
      "cites": ["D11"]
    },
    {
      "text": "An alternate manufacturer option is approved: HEPARIN SODIUM 200 USP units/100mL from Hospira, Inc., substitute NDC with no clinical change, approved by Alex Morgan, PharmD on 2025-12-11.",
      "cites": ["D19"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Current inventory across Corvale sites provides 12 to 19 days on hand at present usage rates.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2", "D3"]
    }
  ]
}
